     3	**Planner:** Claude Fable 5.1 (session xrir-code-25). **Coder:** Claude Opus 5 (Agent, worktree `xRIR_code_wt10`, branch `exp10-yaw-pilot`). **Reviewer:** OpenAI Codex `gpt-6-astra` at **ultra** (SOP setting; round 1 ran at xhigh, see §10). **Date:** 2026-09-26. **Status:** **v3.1 — APPROVED WITH CHANGES** by the round-3 review at ultra (`yaw_pilot_codex_plan_review_round3.md`; its 3 should-fixes + 1 nit are the binding amendments A1–A4 of §12). v3 was the round-2 revision at ultra (`yaw_pilot_codex_plan_review_round2.md`, REQUEST CHANGES, 1 blocker + 5 should-fixes + 2 nits; §11 maps them); v2 was the round-1 revision (`yaw_pilot_codex_plan_review.md`; §10). v1 kept as `plan_yaw_pilot_v1_superseded.md`.
